  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Direct Aid Program 2021-2024 and Australia Mongolia 50th Anniversary Grants</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mongolia Program&apos;s Direct Aid Program (DAP) portfolio of FYs 2021-24 and the Australia Mongolia 50th Anniversary Grants Program (AMAGP). Mongolia DAP is a discretionary annual small grant program to support development and public diplomacy objectives of the Australian Embassy in Ulaanbaatar. AMAGP is a one off flexible small grant program targeted to build networks, strengthen relations and raise Australia&apos;s profile in Mongolia during the 50th anniversary celebrations of diplomatic relations in 2022.</narrative>
  </description>
